==Trivia==
*{{Item|Unalloyed Speed}} is the only Pet Item that is on Bazaar, rather than being on [[Auction House]].
*{{Item|Unalloyed Speed}} is incompatible with all rarities of {{Item|Snail Pet}}, despite its {{stat|Speed}} limiting ability, {{AN|Slow and Steady}} being exclusive to {{Rare}} rarities and higher.
*{{Item|Unalloyed Speed}} is the only pet item that directly increases a cap of a stat.

